From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bpereira <bpereira@cloudflare.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 22:06:17 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Paint optional decorations and read compact DOM storage
 through accessors

Paint optional text style decorations: parley now boxes laid-out underline and
strikethrough decorations and leaves them out for runs that have none, so paint
them only when present.

Read compact DOM storage through accessors: blitz-dom moved rarely used element
data out of line, so read its sidecars, element image layers, list-item data and
inline text layouts through the ElementData accessors. Paint output is unchanged.

Read inline layouts through the rebuilding accessor: blitz-dom evicts the shaped
text of inline roots far from the viewport, so paint reads a root's layout through
the accessor that rebuilds an evicted one instead of reading an empty layout.

Read box child lists through node accessors, since blitz-dom keeps layout and paint
child lists only on box nodes.
---
